OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after pedestrian, 18,
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fan 18-year-old pedestrian was killed by
OL,8,Fa car in Leeds city centre.
OL,10,FThe man was hit by a black BMW i40 M50
OL,11,Fon Park Lane, near to the A58 entry
OL,12,Fslip road just after 21:10 BST on
OL,13,FFriday and was taken to hospital where
OL,14,Fhe died, West Yorkshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe BMW stopped near the scene and
OL,17,Fanother car, a silver Toyota Yaris
OL,18,FT-sport, was identified as being in the
OL,19,Farea at the time of the collision. Both
OL,20,Fvehicles have been recovered, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
